\]

Where:
- \( w_i \) is the weight of the \( i \)-th component in the mixture.
- \( \text{Upper Limit of } i \) is the upper fllevability limit of the \( i \)-th component.
- \( \text{Lower Limit of } } i \) is the lower fllevability limit of the \( i \ththnd component.

### 2. Weight-Weight Rule of Addition (Weight Average):
\[
