   The Riemann-Liouville fractional derivative of a function \( f(t) \) of order \( p \) is defined as:
   \[
   aD_t^p f(t) = \frac{1}{a^{\alpha}} \int_0^t (t - s)^{p - 1} f(s) \, ds,
