2. For the second term, 2cos(4πt):
   The Fourier transform of cos(ωt) is given by:
   F_cos(ω) = (1/2)δ(ω - ω₀) + (1/2)δ(ω + ω₀)
   where ω₀ is the angular frequency of the cosine function.

